# TeX Live packages required to build the demo and the test documents.
#
# This list is consumed by the zauguin/install-texlive GitHub Action
# (see .github/workflows/build.yml). One package per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
# It was generated with DEPP (https://gitlab.com/islandoftex/texmf/depp) by
# compiling demo.tex and tests/*.tex, then adding the engine/build binaries
# (latex-bin, luatex, latexmk) that DEPP does not detect, plus two pieces
# DEPP cannot see (its font detection is luatex-only, and CI compiles with
# pdflatex): amsfonts for the Type1 Computer Modern outlines (e.g. cmssbx10)
# and dvips for the base font encodings (8r.enc) the Palatino fonts need.
# (The Palatino outlines used by mathpazo already come from `palatino`.)
#
# Verified by installing exactly this list on a scheme-infraonly TeX Live
# (no Metafont, as install-texlive provides) and compiling all documents.
amsfonts
babel
babel-german
blindtext
cm
csquotes
dvips
epstopdf-pkg
etoolbox
graphics
graphics-cfg
graphics-def
hyphen-german
iftex
kvoptions
kvsetkeys
l3backend
l3kernel
l3packages
latex
latex-bin
latex-fonts
latexconfig
latexmk
lipsum
lm
ltxcmds
luatex
mathpazo
mwe
palatino
psnfss
tools
